  "ctx_statements": {
   "effective": {
    "value": 262144,
    "quote": "- **Agentic training:** post-trained for agentic harnesses such as Hermes Agent, Pi, and OpenClaw, with a 256K-token context window."
   },
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L51",
   "values": [
    {
     "value": {
      "value": 262144,
      "quote": "- **Agentic training:** post-trained for agentic harnesses such as Hermes Agent, Pi, and OpenClaw, with a 256K-token context window."
     },
     "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L51"
    },
    {
     "value": {
      "value": 262144,
      "quote": "<p><small>All models were served with vLLM in BF16 at their full context length: 262,144 tokens for LFM3-1.7B, Qwen3.5-4B, and Qwen3.5-9B, and 131,072 tokens for LFM2.5-2.6B, MiniCPM5-2B, and Gemma 4 E4B. Unless listed below, every eval use"
     },
     "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L531"
    },
    {
     "value": {
      "value": 32768,
      "quote": "<p><small>All models run as Q4_0 GGUF files in llama.cpp with 32,768 tokens of context, batch size 1, 100 output tokens, and GPU offload. Prefill is the prompt processing speed and decode is the generation speed, both in tokens per second. "
     },
     "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L557"
    },
    {
     "value": {
      "value": 131072,
      "quote": "<img src=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B/resolve/main/assets/lfm3-pre-training-recipe.webp\" alt=\"LFM3-1.7B pre-training: web and synthetic data (about 15T tokens), then code, math, and science (3T tokens at 4K context), followed "
     },
     "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L577"
    },
    {
     "value": {
      "value": 262144,
      "quote": "- **Mid-training:** the last 3.5T tokens use curated, higher-quality data with a larger share of agentic traces and tool calls. This stage also extends the context window to 256K tokens."
     },
     "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B README.md:L582"
    }
   ]
  },
